  "plain": "In 1996, at the Humanitas Hospital in the Brazilian town of Varginha, a military driver says he saw a creature that was not human, with skin that was \"very oily\" and had \"a sort of siliconlike texture.\" The man is not named and tells Michels this as something he saw himself. His account is one of several about Varginha that year, which describe a craft coming down and a living being taken by soldiers to hospital. If true, it would mean the Brazilian military held a live non-human being."
